{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a small demo of Bigfoot Life. It features a small map that will allow you to explore some of the features of the game and allow you to experience a little bit of life as Bigfoot. Catch and eat fish, insects, and other creatures. Forage the forest for mushrooms, berries, and more. Build\u00a0 and upgrade shelters to store your items in. Earn extra points by breaking branches and scaring the wildlife. Acquire new Bigfoot Skills like Bigfoot Vision, and Speed. Watch out for human Bigfoot hunters. \u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574620/extras/Bigfoot_life_steam_Demo_Gif.gif?t=1742813781\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574620?t=1742813781","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3574620?t=1742813781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574620/3b80a85b5025d06049efec4be67103d9a6d6375c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742813781","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3574620/3b80a85b5025d06049efec4be67103d9a6d6375c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742813781","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a small demo of Bigfoot Life. It features a small map that will allow you to explore some of the features of the game and allow you to experience a little bit of life as Bigfoot. Catch and eat fish, insects, and other creatures. Forage the forest for mushrooms, berries, and more. Build\u00a0 and upgrade shelters to store your items in. Earn extra points by breaking branches and scaring the wildlife. Acquire new Bigfoot Skills